{
  "name": "Layer B Lab — Customer Inquiry Router (Grok variant)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🧪 Layer B Lab — Customer Inquiry Router (Grok)\n### Optional vendor variant of the Gemini lab\n\nSame 4D microburst as `customer-inquiry-router.json`, with the official n8n **xAI Grok** path.\n\nGrok is **not** a drop-in replacement for `@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.googleGemini`. n8n exposes Grok as a LangChain **chat-model sub-node** (`lmChatXAiGrok`) that must hang off a **Basic LLM Chain**. Gemini 2.5 Flash remains the repository baseline; this file is the Grok companion.\n\n**How to run this lab**\n1. Import this canvas into your NewPush Labs n8n instance.\n2. Read each coloured **microburst** sticky *before* you configure the node beside it.\n3. Attach your own xAI credential (replace the `REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_…` placeholder). Pick the current Grok chat model in the sub-node if `grok-4` is not listed.\n4. `POST` a test body like `{ \"message\": \"My invoice looks wrong\" }` to `/webhook/customer-inquiry-router-grok`.\n\n> ⚠️ Labs = prototyping only. Use mock / test credentials. Promote to a production cluster only after peer review.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 1120,
        "color": 7
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [0, -520],
      "id": "c1a8e0d2-4b91-4c6e-9f3a-7d2e1b0a9c11",
      "name": "Lab Overview"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1 · DELEGATION\n### \"Is this a task worth handing to an AI?\"\n\n**Delegation** (4D #1) is the discipline of deciding *what* to hand off and *how much* autonomy to grant.\n\nDelegate the *task* (classify this message) to the coworker; keep ownership of the *goal* (every customer reaches the right team).\n\n**This node = the Delegation boundary.** The Webhook is the exact moment a human hands a task to the Virtual Coworker.",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 340,
        "color": 5
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [0, -240],
      "id": "a91c2f44-0d6b-4e1f-8c77-2b5e9a11d003",
      "name": "Microburst — Delegation"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2 · DESCRIPTION\n### \"Say what you want — clearly.\"\n\nThe Basic LLM Chain holds the prompt. The **xAI Grok Chat Model** sub-node is the model. Together they are Description (4D #2).\n\nReturn **only** JSON `{ category, summary, confidence, suggested_reply }` so the Switch can act.",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 360,
        "color": 6
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [360, -240],
      "id": "b02d3e55-1e7c-4f20-9d88-3c6f0b22e114",
      "name": "Microburst — Description"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3 · THE AGENTIC SHIFT\n### From \"chat answer\" → autonomous action\n\nThe Switch reads `JSON.parse($json.text).category` — Basic LLM Chain exposes the completion on `text`, not Gemini's `content.parts[0].text`.",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 340,
        "color": 2
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [760, -240],
      "id": "c13e4f66-2f8d-4031-ae99-4d701c33f225",
      "name": "Microburst — Agentic Shift"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "customer-inquiry-router-grok",
        "responseMode": "lastNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [0, 200],
      "id": "d24f5077-309e-4142-bf00-5e812d440336",
      "name": "Customer Inquiry Webhook",
      "webhookId": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-4789-abcd-ef0123456789"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are the front-desk Virtual Coworker for NewPush. Read the customer's message and decide which single team should handle it.\n\nCUSTOMER MESSAGE:\n{{ $json.body.message }}\n\nCATEGORIES (choose exactly one):\n- \"billing\" — invoices, payments, refunds, pricing, subscription changes.\n- \"technical_support\" — bugs, errors, outages, \"it's not working\", how-to questions.\n- \"sales\" — new business, upgrades, demos, quotes, partnership enquiries.\n- \"other\" — anything unclear, mixed, sensitive, or outside the above. When in doubt, choose \"other\" so a human can decide.\n\nTone: warm, concise, professional.\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON — no markdown, no code fences — in this exact shape:\n{\n  \"category\": \"billing | technical_support | sales | other\",\n  \"summary\": \"one sentence describing the request\",\n  \"confidence\": 0.0,\n  \"suggested_reply\": \"a short, friendly holding reply to the customer\"\n}"
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.7,
      "position": [360, 200],
      "id": "e3506188-410f-4253-c011-6f923e551447",
      "name": "Triage Coworker (Grok)"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "grok-4",
          "mode": "list",
          "cachedResultName": "grok-4"
        },
        "options": {
          "responseFormat": "json_object"
        }
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatXAiGrok",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [360, 420],
      "id": "f4617299-5210-4364-d122-70a34f662558",
      "name": "xAI Grok Chat Model",
      "credentials": {
